        "text": "Study 1 examined the behavioral effects of cognitive reappraisal on regulating negative affect. Using a self-report measure of affect, we assessed the degree to which directed reappraisal stories up-regulated or down-regulated children’s emotional responses to negatively valenced pictures. Study 2 examined changes in functional brain activity associated with the cognitive reappraisal paradigm used in study 1.",
