    "value": "AFNI linear model; constant, linear, and quadratic run-specific terms and six motion parameters as nuisance regressors; current and previous TRs censored when frame-to-frame movement exceeded 1.5 mm; responses estimated from trial onset to 24 seconds post-onset; picture-related response index averaged at 12, 14, and 16 seconds; whole-brain random-effects analysis restricted to pediatric gray-matter voxels",
